{
  "id": "portfolioen1",
  "locale": "en",
  "title": "UGC portfolio: what to show when you are starting out",
  "slug": "ugc-portfolio-what-to-show-when-starting-out",
  "slugHistory": [],
  "excerpt": "No client yet, and a first campaign in sight? A portfolio shows how you work before it shows who you worked for. Five pieces to prepare, presented honestly, and what to remove.",
  "type": "guide",
  "audience": "creators",
  "theme": "create",
  "author": {
    "kind": "organization",
    "name": "AVYOR editorial team"
  },
  "featured": false,
  "cover": {
    "src": "/news/media/ugc-portfolio-what-to-show-when-starting-out-couverture-23d6f83b.webp",
    "width": 1600,
    "height": 900,
    "alt": "AVYOR illustration: a clapperboard in relief, violet, on a midnight blue background."
  },
  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You want to apply to your first campaign, but you have not worked for any brand yet. Your gallery holds holiday videos, two tutorials and an unboxing filmed a year ago. You hesitate to put yourself forward."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A portfolio does not show who you worked for first: it shows how you work.",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Three to five short videos, made for the occasion and presented honestly as personal projects, are enough to prove it. Here is which ones to prepare, and how to present them."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2,
          "id": "what-a-brand-looks-for-in-a-portfolio"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What a brand looks for in a portfolio"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A brand going through your portfolio asks a few simple questions:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Can they make a product understood within seconds?"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Are the sound, the light and the framing clean?"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Does the pace go straight to the point?"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Can they follow an instruction without losing their own voice?"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "None of those questions requires a past client. They require videos made to answer them."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2,
          "id": "without-a-client-personal-projects-presented-as-such"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Without a client: personal projects, presented as such"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Film products you own and genuinely use, as if a brand had asked you to. It is the most direct way to show your work. One rule allows no exception: "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "present these videos as personal projects",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Do not write “for brand X” and do not suggest a collaboration that never happened: a brand that notices will not forgive it, and you will have lost the very thing the portfolio was meant to prove."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "callout",
        "attrs": {
          "variant": "example"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "An honest caption, for example: ",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "bold"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "“Personal project, not commissioned. Goal: show in 15 seconds that these headphones stay in place while running. Constraint I set myself: no on-screen text.”",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2,
          "id": "five-pieces-for-a-first-portfolio"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Five pieces for a first portfolio"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Each one proves a different skill. You do not have to make them all; three well chosen beat five rushed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "table",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "tableHeader",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Piece"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableHeader",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Indicative length"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableHeader",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "What it proves"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Product hook"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "10 to 15 s"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "You catch attention and set out the problem in the first seconds."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Demo or tutorial"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "30 to 45 s"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "You make a use understood, step by step."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Piece to camera"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "20 to 30 s"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "You speak naturally about a product, without reading a script."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Unboxing"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "20 to 40 s"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "You show off an object and its packaging, with no dead time."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Before / after or lifestyle"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "15 to 30 s"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "You show a result, or a product in a believable everyday scene."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "These lengths are landmarks for a first set, not standards: always read the instructions of the campaign you are answering."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2,
          "id": "three-lines-of-context-under-each-video"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Three lines of context under each video"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A video without context leaves the brand guessing what you were after. Add under each:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "orderedList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The goal",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ": what the video had to make clear."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The constraint",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ": the rule you set yourself."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "What you would change",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ": one sentence showing how you look at your own work."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The third line is often the one a brand remembers: it shows that you can take feedback."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2,
          "id": "what-is-better-taken-out"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What is better taken out"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Videos whose sound is not audible without music."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Content with no product and no message, however good: it answers none of the brand’s questions."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Duplicates: two similar unboxings say the same thing."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Anything that could suggest a partnership that does not exist."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2,
          "id": "before-you-apply"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Before you apply"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "callout",
        "attrs": {
          "variant": "checklist"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "bulletList",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Three to five videos, each proving a different skill."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Every personal project is presented as one."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Every video carries its three lines of context."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "The sound is audible without music on all of them."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "The formats requested by the campaign you target are represented."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2,
          "id": "inside-avyor"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Inside AVYOR"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A Creator’s portfolio on AVYOR sorts work by content type, and photos can feed it without going through the feed. To prepare your first pieces, the guided video templates cover seven families of formats — product hook, testimonial, lifestyle, unboxing, tutorial, before/after, storytelling — each with its steps, its length and its difficulty level."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
